# Guard: never serve the SPA HTML fallback for asset URLs. Without this, a
# request for a not-yet-propagated /assets/ file during a deploy's switchover
# window returns index.html with the /assets/* immutable cache header — and
# Cloudflare's edge caches that wrong answer for a year (site goes blank).
# Rewriting to the same path makes a missing asset a plain 404 instead:
# harmless, uncached, self-healing once propagation finishes.
/assets/*    /assets/:splat    200

/*    /index.html   200
